        <source>Read-only: declares no side effects and is served with GET over REST.</source>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="annotation.destructive.help">
        <source>Destructive: deletes or irreversibly alters data, and is served with DELETE over REST.</source>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="annotation.idempotent.help">
        <source>Idempotent: running it again with the same input is safe.</source>
