        <source>Reload</source>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tokens.intro">
        <source>Bearer tokens for the REST projection, bound to your backend user. A token never widens your own permissions: its scopes are intersected with the scopes your backend groups grant. Only the SHA-256 hash is stored, so the token itself is shown exactly once.</source>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tokens.caption">
